OL,3,GNEWSABest of north Devon showcased by
OL,4,Ayoung filmmakers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat people love about the area they
OL,7,Fcome from has been showcased in a set
OL,8,Fof short films made by young people.
OL,10,FThirty of these films have been entered
OL,11,Fin a filmmaking competition named
OL,12,F"Place", organised by North Devon
OL,13,FDistrict Council.
OL,15,FThe aim of the competition for under
OL,16,F25s, is to explore what makes north
OL,17,FDevon special through themes including
OL,18,Fthe coast, the countryside,
OL,19,Fcommunities, culture and wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
