OL,3,GNEWSABest of north Devon showcased by
OL,4,Ayoung filmmakers
OL,5,
OL,6,FClare China, project officer for the
OL,7,Fcouncil, said: "It's their home. It's
OL,8,Fwhere they live. It's where they work
OL,9,Fand study. We wanted to see that
OL,10,Fthrough their eyes, and for them to
OL,11,Ftell us what they think is important
OL,12,Fabout North Devon.
